{"seq":1,"slug":"kubernetes-cost-optimization","title":"Kubernetes 成本优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance/kubernetes-cost-optimization","wordCount":1573,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"kubernetes-成本优化\">Kubernetes 成本优化</h1><p>Kubernetes 把账单和真实消耗解耦了：调度器看的是 <code>requests</code>，而你付钱付的是节点。这条裂缝让 2026 年的审计里反复出现同一个数字——80% 到 90% 的 Pod 带着「以防万一」的虚高 CPU/内存请求在跑（<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/kubernetes-cost-optimization/\">CloudZero, 2026</a>），整个集群里 30% 到 45% 的开销花在闲置资源上，节点利用率常年徘徊在 20% 到 45%（<a href=\"https://scaleops.com/blog/kubernetes-cost-optimization/\">ScaleOps, 2026</a>）。把 Kubernetes 成本优化放进「优化前沿与治理」这一章，恰恰是因为单纯的技术调优会在一个季度内被打回原形——没有治理层兜底，省下来的钱会重新长回去。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Kubernetes 成本优化不是一个动作，而是「分摊 → 看见 → 优化 → 治理」的闭环。FinOps Foundation 把它定位成「让技术工作真正发生的问责层」：没有按 namespace/label/owner 的一致分摊，团队看不见自己的漂移；没有 showback 或 chargeback，他们没有动力去修；没有 ResourceQuota 与 LimitRange 作为策略闸门，集群没有机制阻止回退（<a href=\"https://www.finout.io/blog/top-18-kubernetes-cost-optimization-strategies-in-2026\">Finout, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[节点账单&lt;br/&gt;按机型小时计费] --&gt; B[Pod requests&lt;br/&gt;调度依据 ≠ 真实消耗]&#10;  B --&gt; C[分摊层&lt;br/&gt;namespace/label 归集]&#10;  C --&gt; D[可见性&lt;br/&gt;showback / chargeback]&#10;  D --&gt; E[优化循环&lt;br/&gt;right-sizing + 自动扩缩 + spot]&#10;  E --&gt; F[治理闸门&lt;br/&gt;ResourceQuota / LimitRange]&#10;  F --&gt; B&#10;  D --&gt; G[闲置浪费&lt;br/&gt;30%-45% 集群开销]&#10;  G --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  A[节点账单&lt;br/&gt;按机型小时计费] --&gt; B[Pod requests&lt;br/&gt;调度依据 ≠ 真实消耗]\n  B --&gt; C[分摊层&lt;br/&gt;namespace/label 归集]\n  C --&gt; D[可见性&lt;br/&gt;showback / chargeback]\n  D --&gt; E[优化循环&lt;br/&gt;right-sizing + 自动扩缩 + spot]\n  E --&gt; F[治理闸门&lt;br/&gt;ResourceQuota / LimitRange]\n  F --&gt; B\n  D --&gt; G[闲置浪费&lt;br/&gt;30%-45% 集群开销]\n  G --&gt; E</pre><p>下表对比四个层次各自回答的问题与典型工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>关键机制</th>\n<th>2026 代表工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分摊</td>\n<td>这笔钱是谁花的</td>\n<td>namespace/label 归集、共享成本拆分</td>\n<td>OpenCost、Kubecost</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可见性</td>\n<td>谁该为漂移负责</td>\n<td>showback / chargeback</td>\n<td>Cost Explorer、Kubecost</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优化</td>\n<td>怎么把钱省下来</td>\n<td>right-sizing、HPA/VPA、Karpenter、spot</td>\n<td>Karpenter、VPA、ScaleOps</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>治理</td>\n<td>怎么防止回退</td>\n<td>ResourceQuota、LimitRange、策略即代码</td>\n<td>OPA/Gatekeeper、Kyverno</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"right-sizing-从-requests-的虚高里抠利用率\">right-sizing：从 requests 的虚高里抠利用率</h2><p>调度器按 <code>requests</code> 做 bin-packing，所以请求虚高会直接转化成节点浪费。2026 年的经验值是：哪怕每个 Pod 只下调 5% 到 15% 的请求，经过更好的装箱，整集群也能省 30% 到 60%；第一轮 right-sizing 后节点级利用率通常提升 20% 到 40%，工作负载得以收缩到更少、更满的节点上（<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/kubernetes-cost-optimization/\">CloudZero, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>衡量浪费的核心指标是请求与实际用量的比值。设某 namespace 的 CPU 请求总和为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span>，过去 P95 实际用量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U_{p95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则装箱效率近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow></msub><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = \\frac{U_{p95}}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 长期低于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.4</span></span></span></span></span>，说明请求虚高,是 right-sizing 的首要目标。实操上用 VPA 的 <code>recommender</code> 给出建议值，再以 P95 而非峰值为基准设定请求——峰值设请求会把瞬时尖峰固化成长期成本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# VPA 仅给建议、不自动改写（Off 模式），把决策权留给发布流程&#10;apiVersion: autoscaling.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: VerticalPodAutoscaler&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: api-vpa&#10;spec:&#10;  targetRef:&#10;    apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;    kind: Deployment&#10;    name: api&#10;  updatePolicy:&#10;    updateMode: &#39;Off&#39; # 只产出 recommendation，避免在线重启抖动\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># VPA 仅给建议、不自动改写（Off 模式），把决策权留给发布流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">autoscaling.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VerticalPodAutoscaler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api-vpa</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  targetRef</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Deployment</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  updatePolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    updateMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Off'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 只产出 recommendation，避免在线重启抖动</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自动扩缩与-karpenter-让节点贴着负载走\">自动扩缩与 Karpenter：让节点贴着负载走</h2><p>right-sizing 解决「单个 Pod 要多少」，自动扩缩解决「集群整体跟不跟得上负载」。三类扩缩器分工不同：HPA 按 CPU/内存/自定义指标增减副本数，VPA 按观测负载调整每个 Pod 的请求，节点层则交给 Cluster Autoscaler 或 Karpenter（<a href=\"https://sedai.io/blog/kubernetes-autoscaling\">Sedai, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>一条容易踩的坑：不要让 HPA 与 VPA 跑在同一个指标上。当 HPA 按 CPU 利用率扩缩、VPA 又抬高 CPU 请求时，利用率百分比会被分母拉低，触发本不该发生的缩容；受支持的做法是 VPA 活跃时让 HPA 按队列长度等自定义指标扩缩（<a href=\"https://sedai.io/blog/kubernetes-autoscaling\">Sedai, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>节点层在 2026 年的主角是 Karpenter。它不依赖固定 node group，而是分析 pending Pod 的需求、从一大批机型里直接选最划算的，再持续把工作负载合并到更便宜的节点上、终止利用不足的节点。金融科技公司 PicPay 在 Amazon EKS 上部署 Karpenter 后,月度基础设施成本下降了 50%（<a href=\"https://www.cloudzero.com/blog/kubernetes-cost-optimization/\">CloudZero, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[pending Pod&lt;br/&gt;带 requests/亲和/拓扑约束] --&gt; K[Karpenter&lt;br/&gt;从全机型池选型]&#10;  K --&gt; N[启动恰好够用的节点]&#10;  N --&gt; M[运行中持续 consolidation]&#10;  M --&gt; S{节点利用不足?}&#10;  S --&gt;|是| T[整合并终止节点]&#10;  S --&gt;|否| M&#10;  K --&gt; SP[优先 spot&lt;br/&gt;容错负载省至 90%]\">flowchart TD\n  P[pending Pod&lt;br/&gt;带 requests/亲和/拓扑约束] --&gt; K[Karpenter&lt;br/&gt;从全机型池选型]\n  K --&gt; N[启动恰好够用的节点]\n  N --&gt; M[运行中持续 consolidation]\n  M --&gt; S{节点利用不足?}\n  S --&gt;|是| T[整合并终止节点]\n  S --&gt;|否| M\n  K --&gt; SP[优先 spot&lt;br/&gt;容错负载省至 90%]</pre><h2 id=\"spot-与闲置回收-把可中断负载迁到便宜容量\">spot 与闲置回收：把可中断负载迁到便宜容量</h2><p>对容错型负载，spot 实例最高可省 90%，但前提是工作负载结构上能容忍中断；spot 能削减闲置容量，仅当负载被设计成可被随时打断（<a href=\"https://www.bairesdev.com/blog/kubernetes-cost-optimization/\">BairesDev, 2026</a>）。落地要点：无状态服务、批处理、CI 跑在 spot 上，配 <code>PodDisruptionBudget</code> 兜底；有状态与延迟敏感服务留在按需或预留实例上。</p>\n<p>闲置回收的另一半是「主动清理」。30% 到 45% 的集群开销耗在闲置资源上，常见来源是孤儿 PVC、长期 0 流量的 Deployment、忘记缩容的 staging 环境（<a href=\"https://scaleops.com/blog/kubernetes-cost-optimization/\">ScaleOps, 2026</a>）。把这些纳入定期巡检比一次性大扫除更有效——它们会持续再生。前沿团队综合 right-sizing、智能扩缩、spot、资源清理、节点效率与完整可见性，稳定拿到 40% 到 70% 的降幅（<a href=\"https://www.finout.io/blog/top-18-kubernetes-cost-optimization-strategies-in-2026\">Finout, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分摊-治理与-finops-框架对齐\">分摊、治理与 FinOps 框架对齐</h2><p>技术优化要持久，必须挂在 FinOps 框架上。2026 版框架把若干能力做了重命名与重构：Workload Optimization 改为 Usage Optimization，Policy &amp; Governance 改为 Governance, Policy &amp; Risk，并在「管理 FinOps 实践」域新增了 Executive Strategy Alignment 能力；同时 Scopes 成为框架核心元素，允许把框架应用到「跨公有云与本地数据中心的混合 Kubernetes 部署」这类具体技术段（<a href=\"https://www.finops.org/insights/2026-finops-framework/\">FinOps Foundation, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>分摊是这一切的地基，但现实差距很大：完整分摊云开销是 FinOps 第二优先级，78% 的 FinOps 实践已向 CTO/CIO 汇报，可只有 14% 的组织真正跑 chargeback（<a href=\"https://www.convox.com/blog/kubernetes-cost-allocation-showback-chargeback-guide\">Convox, 2026</a>）。务实路线是 namespace 级分摊——它用 10% 的工夫拿到 90% 的价值。工具上，OpenCost 是 CNCF 沙箱里的开源分摊引擎与规范，Kubecost 是建在其上的商业产品，补上更丰富界面、更长数据保留、多集群聚合、告警与治理（<a href=\"https://opencost.io/docs/\">OpenCost, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 治理闸门：用 ResourceQuota + LimitRange 防止请求虚高回潮&#10;apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: ResourceQuota&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: team-quota&#10;  namespace: team-payments&#10;spec:&#10;  hard:&#10;    requests.cpu: &#39;40&#39;&#10;    requests.memory: 80Gi&#10;    limits.cpu: &#39;80&#39;&#10;---&#10;apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: LimitRange&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: default-limits&#10;  namespace: team-payments&#10;spec:&#10;  limits:&#10;    - type: Container&#10;      default: { cpu: 500m, memory: 512Mi }&#10;      defaultRequest: { cpu: 100m, memory: 128Mi } # 没写 requests 的容器有合理默认，避免裸奔\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 治理闸门：用 ResourceQuota + LimitRange 防止请求虚高回潮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ResourceQuota</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">team-quota</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">team-payments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hard</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    requests.cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'40'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    requests.memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">80Gi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    limits.cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'80'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">LimitRange</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">default-limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">team-payments</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Container</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">500m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">512Mi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      defaultRequest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cpu</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">100m</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">128Mi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 没写 requests 的容器有合理默认，避免裸奔</span></span></code></pre></div><p>正确顺序很关键：先建分摊，再选 showback 还是 chargeback，再施加 ResourceQuota 与 LimitRange，最后才跑技术优化循环；不带 FinOps 层就跑循环，省出来的钱一个季度内就会侵蚀掉（<a href=\"https://oneuptime.com/blog/post/2026-02-09-finops-cost-allocation-kubecost/view\">OneUptime, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Kubernetes 的账单与消耗解耦：付费按节点，调度按 <code>requests</code>，裂缝产生 30%-45% 的闲置浪费。</li>\n<li>right-sizing 以 P95 而非峰值设请求，每 Pod 下调 5%-15% 经 bin-packing 可放大成 30%-60% 集群级节省。</li>\n<li>HPA 与 VPA 不要共用同一指标；节点层用 Karpenter 做选型与 consolidation，实战见过 50% 降幅。</li>\n<li>容错负载迁 spot 最高省 90%，配 PodDisruptionBudget；闲置回收要做成定期巡检而非一次性清理。</li>\n<li>治理是持久性的来源：先分摊、再 showback/chargeback、再 ResourceQuota/LimitRange、最后才跑优化循环——顺序反了，省下的钱会在一季度内长回来。</li>\n<li>对齐 2026 FinOps 框架的 Usage Optimization 与 Governance, Policy &amp; Risk 能力，用 Scopes 圈定混合 Kubernetes 这一技术段。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Kubernetes 成本优化","id":"kubernetes-成本优化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"right-sizing：从 requests 的虚高里抠利用率","id":"right-sizing-从-requests-的虚高里抠利用率"},{"level":2,"text":"自动扩缩与 Karpenter：让节点贴着负载走","id":"自动扩缩与-karpenter-让节点贴着负载走"},{"level":2,"text":"spot 与闲置回收：把可中断负载迁到便宜容量","id":"spot-与闲置回收-把可中断负载迁到便宜容量"},{"level":2,"text":"分摊、治理与 FinOps 框架对齐","id":"分摊-治理与-finops-框架对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Spot 实例与负载调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-optimization-techniques/spot-and-workload-scheduling"},"next":{"title":"存储与数据传输成本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance/storage-and-data-transfer-cost"}}